          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只对判定为中文的歌词生效，例如 你好 → nǐ hǎo；默认关闭，中文歌词加拼音对中文读者通常是干扰" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Applies only to lyrics judged Chinese, e.g. 你好 → nǐ hǎo; off by default, since pinyin over Chinese lyrics is usually a distraction for Chinese readers"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
