    "只对判定为该语言的歌词生效；判定按整首歌进行，混排的歌以出现的假名/谚文/汉字为准。中文默认关闭——中文歌词加拼音对中文读者通常是干扰" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Applies only to lyrics detected as that language. Detection runs per song, using the kana / hangul / han characters that appear. Chinese is off by default — pinyin over Chinese lyrics is usually a distraction for readers of Chinese"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
