    },
    "多位歌手合唱时（如「Khalil Fong & Fiona Sit」）上送哪个名字。\n\n全部：原样发整串。\n\n只发第一位：只发「Khalil Fong」——Last.fm 上的记录里另一位歌手不会出现。\n\n智能：Last.fm 上已有「Khalil Fong & Fiona Sit」这个合唱条目就原样发；没有、而「Khalil Fong」名下已有这首歌就只发「Khalil Fong」；两边都查不到时原样发。每首歌只判一次，之后一直沿用。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Which name is submitted when several artists are credited (e.g. \"Khalil Fong & Fiona Sit\").\n\nAll: the full credit is sent as-is.\n\nFirst only: just \"Khalil Fong\" — the other artist will not appear in your Last.fm history.\n\nSmart: if Last.fm already has a \"Khalil Fong & Fiona Sit\" entry for the track, the full credit is sent; if it doesn't but \"Khalil Fong\" already has this track, only \"Khalil Fong\" is sent; if neither is found, the full credit is sent. Each track is decided once and the decision sticks."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "多位歌手合唱时（如「Khalil Fong & Fiona Sit」）上送哪个名字。\n\n全部：原样发整串。\n\n只发第一位：只发「Khalil Fong」——Last.fm 上的记录里另一位歌手不会出现。\n\n智能：Last.fm 上已有「Khalil Fong & Fiona Sit」这个合唱条目就原样发；没有、而「Khalil Fong」名下已有这首歌就只发「Khalil Fong」；两边都查不到时原样发。每首歌只判一次，之后一直沿用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "多位歌手合唱時（如「Khalil Fong & Fiona Sit」）送出哪個名字。\n\n全部：原樣送出整串。\n\n只送出第一位：只送「Khalil Fong」——Last.fm 上的記錄裡不會出現另一位歌手。\n\n智慧：Last.fm 上已有「Khalil Fong & Fiona Sit」這個合唱項目就原樣送出；沒有、而「Khalil Fong」名下已有這首歌就只送「Khalil Fong」；兩邊都查不到時原樣送出。每首歌只判定一次，之後一直沿用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
