    "自己用 Cloudflare Worker + KV 搭建的 state-worker 服务（独立公开仓库 Yudaotor/nowplaying-workers）。不想自建也行：配好「ListenBrainz」也能让网页兜底显示「正在播放」，两者配一个就够。效果截图 + 完整从零搭建步骤见该仓库自己的 README" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A state-worker service you host yourself on Cloudflare Workers + KV (separate public repo: Yudaotor/nowplaying-workers). Self-hosting is optional: connecting “ListenBrainz” also lets the web page fall back to showing “Now Playing”, and either one alone is enough. That repo's own README has screenshots and full setup steps"
          }
