    "Lyrimuse 住在屏幕右上角的菜单栏里，点它就能打开设置、歌词管理和歌词窗口；按住 ⌘ 拖动可以把图标挪个位置。常用操作还能在设置的「快捷键」里配上全局热键" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lyrimuse lives in the menu bar at the top right — click it to open Settings, the lyrics manager and the lyrics window. Hold ⌘ and drag to move the icon somewhere else. You can also set global hotkeys under Shortcuts in Settings"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lyrimuse 住在屏幕右上角的菜单栏里，点它就能打开设置、歌词管理和歌词窗口；按住 ⌘ 拖动可以把图标挪个位置。常用操作还能在设置的「快捷键」里配上全局热键"
