    "菜单栏歌词的字号。默认跟随系统菜单栏，可在 10 到 16pt 之间调；字号越大歌词越高一点，16pt 仍在菜单栏项的高度以内。拖回系统字号那一格就回到跟随系统" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Font size of the menu bar lyrics. Follows the system menu bar by default; adjustable from 10 to 16pt. Larger sizes make the lyrics a little taller, and 16pt still fits within the menu bar item. Drag back to the system size to follow it again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "選單列歌詞的字級。預設跟隨系統選單列，可在 10 到 16pt 之間調；字級越大歌詞越高一點，16pt 仍在選單列項目的高度以內。拖回系統字級那一格就回到跟隨系統"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "菜单栏歌词的笔画粗细。字体族继续跟随系统菜单栏，「常规」就是系统菜单栏本来的粗细；中文只变粗不变宽，英文越粗越宽一点" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "How heavy the menu bar lyrics are drawn. The font family keeps following the system menu bar; Regular is exactly the system default weight. Chinese only gets bolder, Latin text also gets slightly wider."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "選單列歌詞的筆畫粗細。字體族繼續跟隨系統選單列，「標準」就是系統選單列本來的粗細；中文只變粗不變寬，英文越粗越寬一點"
