    "勾选的播放器全部退出后，等 5 秒再退出 Lyrimuse；期间任一个重新打开就取消。设置、歌词管理或歌词窗口开着时不退" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once every checked player has quit, Lyrimuse quits after a 5-second grace period; if any of them reopens in the meantime, the quit is cancelled. It never quits while Settings, Lyrics Manager or the lyrics window is open"
          }
        },
